# Behavioral eval runs write raw agent transcripts. Never commit them.
# Leading **/ so the rules reach a runs directory wherever a run writes one,
# not only the one at the repository root. That includes the per-skill evals
# tree tools/test_eval_artifacts.py now forbids, which keeps a transcript out
# of git even on the layout the lint rejects.
**/evals/**/runs/
**/eval-runs/

# Harvest review sheets awaiting a human tick or strike. They quote real user
# prompts, so they stay out of git until reviewed.
**/review-inbox/

# Agent worktrees that hold unpushed work, per the pstack-harness skill.
.worktrees/
eval-runs/
evals/runs/
